{room, key=master_bedroom, name=Master Bedroom
    {attrib, output=false, tags=tested }
    {attrib, tags=navigation
        output={@
North: hallway
        }
    }

    {enter_message
        {act, logic=story, tags=!_type|room }
    }

    {story
        {message
            output={@

You have never really been inside your parents' bedroom. If feels really
weird.

A large bed sits against the east wall. It is neatly made and there are two
wide pillows on it. Nothing more.

South of the bed is a nightstand and beyond that is a small sitting area
With a round table and one velvet chair next to it.

In the south wall is a door to the walk in closet which appears to take up
nearly the entire width of the room.

The west wall is right next to the bedroom door, then it angles away, so that
the bedroom opens up some more. There is a narrow door in the west wall that
leads to the bathroom.

            }
        }
    }

    {look
        {message
            output={@

A large bed sits against the east wall.

South of the bed is a nightstand and beyond that is a small sitting area.

In the south wall is a door to the walk in closet.

In the west wall is a narrow door to the bathroom.

            }
        }

        {logic, name=Master tested, tags=!_test
            logic={@
                ?[self]((tested)) = 'true'
            }
        }
    }



    {inject, logic=./objects/bed.inj }
    {inject, logic=./objects/nightstand.inj }
    {inject, logic=./objects/table.inj }
    {inject, logic=./objects/chair.inj }




    {inject, logic=/nav.inj }
    {inject, logic=/look.inj }
   

    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((go_north))
        {move, logic=hallway, tags=[player]
            output={@

You return to the hallway.

            }
        }
    }



    
    {dev_note, tags=Testing, active=true
        output={@
[ ] : Room
[ ] : Look
[X] : Story

[ ] : Navigation
        }
    }
}
